n check has not passed. Quote bytes you actually fetched with a line number/page label; absent text is a refusal verdict, never a softened one.\n\n# Lane facts\n- Baseline lane tip f20a1097; build-wave reports at .ufo/waves/round-32/build/ (34 reports). Registry 91 rows pre-append; the about-to-land append adds S094/S097/S101/S102 and adds S093 used-by. Entry and rows are on disk uncommitted — you may read them as the drafts.\n- Frozen counters live at plans/round32_defects.py, plans/catalog_probe.py, plans/round32_c1_verify.py, plans/adoption_check.py (all uncommitted edits are the lane's planned state). Access date 2026-10-25.",
